     - rounded pi values (1.5708 / 3.1416) replaced with exact values
     - single named material instead of empty material names -->
<!-- ROS 2 description (open_manipulator_x6_description), 2026-11-03:
     - joints renamed to the arm_driver names: joint1..joint5, wrist_rotate (was joint_1..joint_6);
       the fingers keep left/right_finger_joint (gripper_joint_bridge converts the driver's
       'gripper' angle to left_finger_joint metres)
     - inertials re-estimated from the meshes (tools/compute_inertials.py): the export used
       1.00 g/cm3 for everything; now servos at datasheet mass (XM430-W350 82 g, XL430-W250 57.2 g)
       and printed PLA at 0.93 g/cm3 (60 % infill). The finger inertials were also swapped
       left/right in the export. ESTIMATES: replace with weighed values (MEASURED_G in the tool)
     - collision meshes simplified to convex pieces (meshes/collision/)
     - gripper_tcp moved from 0.06 to 0.12 m (fingertips reach ~0.139 m); wrist_cam frame added
